{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/performance-optimization","wordCount":500,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化实战\">性能优化实战</h1><p>Compose 的声明式模型虽然减少了手动 UI 管理的复杂度，但不意味着性能免费——不当的状态管理、过度重组、布局嵌套和绘制开销仍然会导致卡顿。本文系统化覆盖 Compose 性能优化的完整工具链和方法论：从测量定位（Composition Tracing、Layout Inspector、Macrobenchmark）到针对性优化（减少重组范围、defer 读取、Baseline Profile），构建一套可量化的性能调优体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 的渲染管线分为三个阶段，性能问题可能出现在任何一个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Composition 阶段&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Layout 阶段&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Drawing 阶段&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;过度重组&quot;| D[&quot;Recomposition Count ↑&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;复杂测量&quot;| E[&quot;Layout Duration ↑&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;重绘开销&quot;| F[&quot;Draw Command Count ↑&quot;]&#10;&#10;    G[&quot;Baseline Profile&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;预编译热路径&quot;| H[&quot;启动速度 ↑&quot;]&#10;    I[&quot;R8 优化&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;移除未用代码&quot;| J[&quot;APK 体积 ↓&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Composition 阶段\"] --&gt; B[\"Layout 阶段\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Drawing 阶段\"]\n\n    A --&gt;|\"过度重组\"| D[\"Recomposition Count ↑\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"复杂测量\"| E[\"Layout Duration ↑\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"重绘开销\"| F[\"Draw Command Count ↑\"]\n\n    G[\"Baseline Profile\"] --&gt;|\"预编译热路径\"| H[\"启动速度 ↑\"]\n    I[\"R8 优化\"] --&gt;|\"移除未用代码\"| J[\"APK 体积 ↓\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化维度</th>\n<th>检测工具</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>目标阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重组频率</td>\n<td>Composition Tracing / Recomposition Counter</td>\n<td>重组次数/帧</td>\n<td>每帧 &lt; 3 个不必要重组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧耗时</td>\n<td>Macrobenchmark / Perfetto</td>\n<td>frame duration</td>\n<td>&lt; 16ms (60fps)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动速度</td>\n<td>Macrobenchmark startup</td>\n<td>Time to Initial Display</td>\n<td>&lt; 500ms (冷启动)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动流畅度</td>\n<td>Macrobenchmark scroll</td>\n<td>Jank frame %</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分配</td>\n<td>Android Studio Profiler</td>\n<td>Allocation count/frame</td>\n<td>避免大量 per-frame 分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"减少不必要的重组\">减少不必要的重组</h2><h3 id=\"缩小重组范围\">缩小重组范围</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 不推荐：整个 Row 在 counter 变化时重组&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CounterRow(counter: Int) {&#10;    Row {&#10;        Text(&quot;Label: &quot;)                    // 无需重组&#10;        Text(&quot;Count: $counter&quot;)            // 需要更新&#10;        Icon(Icons.Default.Add, null)      // 无需重组&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 推荐：将变化的部分提取为独立 Composable&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CounterRow(counter: Int) {&#10;    Row {&#10;        Text(&quot;Label: &quot;)&#10;        CounterText(counter)  // 只有这里重组&#10;        Icon(Icons.Default.Add, null)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CounterText(counter: Int) {&#10;    Text(&quot;Count: $counter&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 不推荐：整个 Row 在 counter 变化时重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CounterRow(counter: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Label: \")                    // 无需重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Count: $counter\")            // 需要更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Icon(Icons.Default.Add, null)      // 无需重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 推荐：将变化的部分提取为独立 Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CounterRow(counter: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"Label: \")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CounterText(counter)  // 只有这里重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Icon(Icons.Default.Add, null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CounterText(counter: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(\"Count: $counter\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"defer-读取-延迟到需要的阶段\">Defer 读取：延迟到需要的阶段</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 问题：在 Composition 阶段读取频繁变化的值&#10;// 导致每次滚动都触发重组&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ScrollHeader(scrollState: ScrollState) {&#10;    val alpha = 1f - (scrollState.value / 500f).coerceIn(0f, 1f)&#10;    // scrollState.value 在 Composition 阶段被读取&#10;    // → 每帧滚动都触发 ScrollHeader 重组&#10;    Header(modifier = Modifier.alpha(alpha))&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化：将读取延迟到 Layout/Drawing 阶段&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ScrollHeader(scrollState: ScrollState) {&#10;    Header(&#10;        modifier = Modifier.graphicsLayer {&#10;            // 在 Drawing 阶段读取 → 不触发重组，只触发重绘&#10;            alpha = 1f - (scrollState.value / 500f).coerceIn(0f, 1f)&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 原理：&#10;// - Composition 阶段读取 State → 触发 Recomposition&#10;// - Layout 阶段读取 State（Modifier.layout{}）→ 只触发 relayout + redraw&#10;// - Drawing 阶段读取 State（graphicsLayer{}）→ 只触发 redraw\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 问题：在 Composition 阶段读取频繁变化的值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 导致每次滚动都触发重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ScrollHeader(scrollState: ScrollState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val alpha = 1f - (scrollState.value / 500f).coerceIn(0f, 1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // scrollState.value 在 Composition 阶段被读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // → 每帧滚动都触发 ScrollHeader 重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Header(modifier = Modifier.alpha(alpha))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 优化：将读取延迟到 Layout/Drawing 阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ScrollHeader(scrollState: ScrollState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Header(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.graphicsLayer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 在 Drawing 阶段读取 → 不触发重组，只触发重绘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            alpha = 1f - (scrollState.value / 500f).coerceIn(0f, 1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原理：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - Composition 阶段读取 State → 触发 Recomposition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - Layout 阶段读取 State（Modifier.layout{}）→ 只触发 relayout + redraw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - Drawing 阶段读取 State（graphicsLayer{}）→ 只触发 redraw</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"derivedstateof-减少下游重组\">derivedStateOf 减少下游重组</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 场景：列表滚动时判断是否显示&quot;回到顶部&quot;按钮&#10;@Composable&#10;fun SmartList(listState: LazyListState) {&#10;    // 不推荐：firstVisibleItemIndex 每帧变化 → 每帧重组&#10;    val showButton = listState.firstVisibleItemIndex &gt; 5&#10;&#10;    // 推荐：derivedStateOf 只在布尔值翻转时才通知下游&#10;    val showButton by remember {&#10;        derivedStateOf { listState.firstVisibleItemIndex &gt; 5 }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (showButton) {&#10;        ScrollToTopButton(...)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 场景：列表滚动时判断是否显示\"回到顶部\"按钮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SmartList(listState: LazyListState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 不推荐：firstVisibleItemIndex 每帧变化 → 每帧重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val showButton = listState.firstVisibleItemIndex > 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 推荐：derivedStateOf 只在布尔值翻转时才通知下游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val showButton by remember {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        derivedStateOf { listState.firstVisibleItemIndex > 5 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (showButton) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ScrollToTopButton(...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"baseline-profile\">Baseline Profile</h2><p>Baseline Profile 让 ART 在安装时预编译应用的热路径，消除前几次启动的 JIT 编译开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// benchmark/src/main/java/BaselineProfileGenerator.kt&#10;@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class BaselineProfileGenerator {&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val rule = BaselineProfileRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun generateProfile() {&#10;        rule.collect(&#10;            packageName = &quot;com.example.app&quot;&#10;        ) {&#10;            // 模拟关键用户路径&#10;            pressHome()&#10;            startActivityAndWait()&#10;&#10;            // 等待首页加载&#10;            device.waitForIdle()&#10;&#10;            // 滚动列表（热路径）&#10;            device.findObject(By.scrollable(true))&#10;                .scroll(Direction.DOWN, 3f)&#10;&#10;            // 导航到详情页&#10;            device.findObject(By.text(&quot;Item 1&quot;)).click()&#10;            device.waitForIdle()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 效果：&#10;// - 冷启动速度提升 20-40%&#10;// - 首帧渲染速度提升 30%+&#10;// - 滚动卡顿帧减少 50%+\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// benchmark/src/main/java/BaselineProfileGenerator.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class BaselineProfileGenerator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val rule = BaselineProfileRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun generateProfile() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rule.collect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            packageName = \"com.example.app\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 模拟关键用户路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pressHome()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startActivityAndWait()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 等待首页加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            device.waitForIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 滚动列表（热路径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            device.findObject(By.scrollable(true))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .scroll(Direction.DOWN, 3f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 导航到详情页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            device.findObject(By.text(\"Item 1\")).click()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            device.waitForIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 效果：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 冷启动速度提升 20-40%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 首帧渲染速度提升 30%+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 滚动卡顿帧减少 50%+</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"macrobenchmark-实战\">Macrobenchmark 实战</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class ScrollBenchmark {&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val benchmarkRule = MacrobenchmarkRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun scrollComposeList() {&#10;        benchmarkRule.measureRepeated(&#10;            packageName = &quot;com.example.app&quot;,&#10;            metrics = listOf(&#10;                FrameTimingMetric(),  // 帧耗时&#10;                TraceSectionMetric(&quot;compose:recompose&quot;)  // 重组耗时&#10;            ),&#10;            iterations = 5,&#10;            startupMode = StartupMode.WARM&#10;        ) {&#10;            startActivityAndWait()&#10;&#10;            val list = device.findObject(By.scrollable(true))&#10;            list.setGestureMargin(device.displayWidth / 5)&#10;&#10;            repeat(3) {&#10;                list.scroll(Direction.DOWN, 2f)&#10;                device.waitForIdle()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ScrollBenchmark {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val benchmarkRule = MacrobenchmarkRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun scrollComposeList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        benchmarkRule.measureRepeated(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            packageName = \"com.example.app\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            metrics = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                FrameTimingMetric(),  // 帧耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                TraceSectionMetric(\"compose:recompose\")  // 重组耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            iterations = 5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startupMode = StartupMode.WARM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startActivityAndWait()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val list = device.findObject(By.scrollable(true))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            list.setGestureMargin(device.displayWidth / 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeat(3) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                list.scroll(Direction.DOWN, 2f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                device.waitForIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"composition-tracing\">Composition Tracing</h2><p>Compose 1.3+ 支持在 System Trace 中标记每个 Composable 的重组，配合 Perfetto 可视化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;androidx.compose.runtime:runtime-tracing:1.8.0&quot;)&#10;    debugImplementation(&quot;androidx.tracing:tracing-perfetto:1.0.0&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用方法：&#10;// 1. 连接设备，打开 Perfetto&#10;// 2. 运行应用，执行交互&#10;// 3. 在 Trace 中搜索 &quot;compose:&quot; 前缀&#10;// 4. 查看哪些 Composable 被重组、耗时多少&#10;&#10;// 也可以用 Layout Inspector 的 Recomposition Counts：&#10;// Android Studio → Layout Inspector → Show Recomposition Counts&#10;// 红色数字 = 重组次数，蓝色 = 跳过次数&#10;// 目标：频繁重组的组件应该有高跳过率\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"androidx.compose.runtime:runtime-tracing:1.8.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    debugImplementation(\"androidx.tracing:tracing-perfetto:1.0.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用方法：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 连接设备，打开 Perfetto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 运行应用，执行交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 在 Trace 中搜索 \"compose:\" 前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. 查看哪些 Composable 被重组、耗时多少</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 也可以用 Layout Inspector 的 Recomposition Counts：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Android Studio → Layout Inspector → Show Recomposition Counts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 红色数字 = 重组次数，蓝色 = 跳过次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 目标：频繁重组的组件应该有高跳过率</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lazylist-性能清单\">LazyList 性能清单</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 1. 提供稳定 key&#10;items(data, key = { it.id }) { ... }&#10;&#10;// 2. 提供 contentType&#10;items(data, key = { it.id }, contentType = { it.type }) { ... }&#10;&#10;// 3. 避免 item 内部嵌套滚动方向一致的 Lazy 组件&#10;// ❌ LazyColumn 内嵌 LazyColumn&#10;// ✅ LazyColumn 内用固定高度 + 水平 LazyRow&#10;&#10;// 4. 避免在 item lambda 内创建新对象&#10;// ❌ items(data) { ItemCard(modifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp)) }&#10;// ✅ val itemModifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp)  // 提到外面&#10;//    items(data) { ItemCard(modifier = itemModifier) }&#10;&#10;// 5. 图片使用固定尺寸占位&#10;// ❌ AsyncImage(model = url, contentDescription = null)&#10;// ✅ AsyncImage(model = url, ..., modifier = Modifier.size(64.dp))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 提供稳定 key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items(data, key = { it.id }) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 提供 contentType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items(data, key = { it.id }, contentType = { it.type }) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 避免 item 内部嵌套滚动方向一致的 Lazy 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ LazyColumn 内嵌 LazyColumn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ LazyColumn 内用固定高度 + 水平 LazyRow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. 避免在 item lambda 内创建新对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ items(data) { ItemCard(modifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp)) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ val itemModifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp)  // 提到外面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//    items(data) { ItemCard(modifier = itemModifier) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 5. 图片使用固定尺寸占位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ AsyncImage(model = url, contentDescription = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ AsyncImage(model = url, ..., modifier = Modifier.size(64.dp))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Compose 性能优化的三个阶段：Composition（减少重组）→ Layout（简化测量）→ Drawing（降低绘制）</li>\n<li>Defer 读取是最高杠杆的优化：将 State 读取从 Composition 延迟到 Drawing 阶段</li>\n<li><code>derivedStateOf</code> 过滤高频变化，只在输出值改变时通知下游</li>\n<li>Baseline Profile 预编译热路径，冷启动提速 20-40%</li>\n<li>Macrobenchmark + Composition Tracing 提供可量化的性能测量</li>\n<li>LazyList 的 key + contentType + 避免 per-item 分配是列表性能的基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/strong-skipping-and-stability\">Strong Skipping 与稳定性</a>——理解编译器跳过机制是优化重组的前提</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ui/lazy-layout-internals\">LazyLayout 内部机制</a>——虚拟化列表的预取与回收策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/build-and-release/gradle-fundamentals\">Android 开发基础 · Gradle 基础</a>——Baseline Profile 的构建配置与发布流程</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能优化实战","id":"性能优化实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"减少不必要的重组","id":"减少不必要的重组"},{"level":3,"text":"缩小重组范围","id":"缩小重组范围"},{"level":3,"text":"Defer 读取：延迟到需要的阶段","id":"defer-读取-延迟到需要的阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"derivedStateOf 减少下游重组","id":"derivedstateof-减少下游重组"},{"level":2,"text":"Baseline Profile","id":"baseline-profile"},{"level":2,"text":"Macrobenchmark 实战","id":"macrobenchmark-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"Composition Tracing","id":"composition-tracing"},{"level":2,"text":"LazyList 性能清单","id":"lazylist-性能清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Compose 编译器原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/compose-compiler-internals"},"next":{"title":"Compose Multiplatform 跨平台开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/compose-multiplatform"}}